      "itemList": [
        {
          "id": 1616,
          "title": "Measuring Training Effectiveness",
          "description": "After a session, most trainers wonder did it actually work? Did learners understand the material? \n\nWith Formester, you can easily collect feedback, test scores, and completion rates. \n\nIt helps you see what’s working and what’s not, so you can improve your courses and show real results to stakeholders.\n",
          "description_markdown": "After a session, most trainers wonder did it actually work? Did learners understand the material? \n\nWith Formester, you can easily collect feedback, test scores, and completion rates. \n\nIt helps you see what’s working and what’s not, so you can improve your courses and show real results to stakeholders.\n\n**[View Full Use Case->](/use-case/formester-for-training-evaluations/)**",
          "icon": null,
          "cardImage": {
            "id": 1839,
            "imageAlt": "image of people attending a training program",
            "imageUrl": null,
            "width": null,
            "height": null,
