        {
          "id": 1612,
          "title": "Handling Heavy Course Registrations",
          "description": "When registration opens for a new batch, you often get flooded with sign-ups.\n\nInstead of managing messy spreadsheets or answering endless emails, Formester organizes everything in one place. \n\nThis makes your process faster, more professional, and way easier to manage during busy periods.\n",
          "description_markdown": "When registration opens for a new batch, you often get flooded with sign-ups.\n\nInstead of managing messy spreadsheets or answering endless emails, Formester organizes everything in one place. \n\nThis makes your process faster, more professional, and way easier to manage during busy periods.\n",
          "icon": null,
