        {
          "id": 1620,
          "title": "Tracking Attendance for Company Trainings",
          "description": "When you train employees for a company, they expect proper attendance records. \n\nFormester lets you take roll digitally and share neat reports right away. \n\nThis builds trust with your clients and shows them you’re running a reliable, well-organized training program.\n",
