        {
          "id": 1615,
          "title": "Getting Feedback from Remote or Online Learners",
          "description": "Collecting feedback from learners spread across cities or even countries can be tricky. \n\nWith Formester, you just send a link and get instant responses. No follow-ups, no delays. \n\nIt makes feedback easy, so you can improve sessions quickly and keep learners engaged.\n",
