        {
          "id": 1614,
          "title": "Sending Course Certificates Automatically",
          "description": "Creating and emailing certificates one by one takes forever. \n\nFormester can send them out automatically as soon as someone finishes the course or passes a quiz. \n\nThis saves you time and gives learners a great experience. They get their certificate right away without asking.\n",
